                (g p.1 * star (g p.2)).re)
      _ ≤ ∫ p, a / 4 * (‖g p.1‖ * ‖g p.2‖) ∂(μ.prod μ) := by
          refine integral_mono_ae hF_int.norm hbnd_int ?_
          rw [Measure.prod_restrict]
